- activity feed: tool ids with the dots turned into spaces ('ran test simulate', 'VP ran attempt retry per ladder');
- call page: 'did not return JSON' and 'None; they are suppressed';
- cost basis: a file path and an ISO date;
- stack card: 'first token', 'bake-off', 'ungated', 'the owner's pick';
- contact page: 'Asia/Kolkata', 'Dnd unknown', the raw code 'te', ISO dates, 'Fresh: No';
- campaign header: 'policy v1'.
The browser scan missed them because it only matched dotted tool ids. Not reviewed: the other 19 screen pairs.
